==Lithuanian==
{{wikipedia|lang=lt}}
[[File:Doberman Pinscher down.jpg|thumb|right|250px|Šitas '''šuo''' yra [[dobermanas]] - This dog is a Dobermann.]]

===Etymology===
{{root|lt|ine-pro|*ḱwen-}}
From {{inh|lt|ine-bsl-pro|*kwṓ|t=dog}}; compare {{cog|lv|suns}}, {{cog|prg|sunis||dog}}, {{cog|sla-pro|*sùka||bitch}}, from {{inh|lt|ine-pro|*ḱwṓ||dog}}. Cognate to {{cog|hy|շուն}}, {{cog|sa|श्वन्|tr=śvā́}}, {{cog|la|canis}}, {{cog|gem-pro|*hundaz}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lt|/ʃuə/}}

===Noun===
{{lt-noun|m|šùnys|4|head=šuõ|f=kalė̃}}

# [[dog]] {{gloss|domestic or {{w|Canis|Canis spp.}}}}
# {{lb|lt|vulgar}} a [[detestable]], [[unpleasant]] person; [[bastard]]

